# Thalia, Guardian of Thraben makes March of Otherworldly Light cost {1} more. With only a Plains untapped and no white card in
# hand, Bot1 can't cast it even for X = 0 ({1}{W}). Once it draws Swords to Plowshares it can: exiling it takes {2} off the
# total cost after the tax is added (CR 601.2f: the total is the cost plus increases less reductions, never below {0}), so
# X = 1 costs {1}{1}{W} less {2}, just {W} - a reduction taken before the tax would leave {1}{W}, more than the Plains pays.
# Announced without a value, X would start at 2, what the reduction pays for, so this one is said. The Ornithopter is exiled.

